{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of two real numbers is a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and the sum of their squares is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92a35dd56c72e366504f12a4b01f9488c75a4f19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n + 1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />. Find the maximum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>രണ്ട് യഥാർത്ഥ സംഖ്യകളുടെ തുക ഒരു ധനപൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യയായ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> ആണ്, കൂടാതെ അവയുടെ വർഗ്ഗങ്ങളുടെ തുക <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/518638a4efd1c669d01ccc4151232d4b7864c5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />-ന്റെ സാധ്യമായ ഏറ്റവും വലിയ മൂല്യം കണ്ടെത്തുക.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/7789a92cb455eed96fada02182bc89a15a35176d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade57d3ffe05a8dd8366fbb806794ac49d88151d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = n + 1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />. That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75eb9f2324e996016b68a3fdc75851d6a677bed1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)^2 - 2ab = n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22b20a0c01ae7f7ad257f5a7ba94baef621ceb39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2ab = n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a98438a8d6699b37c8ea4a240ee44f710bf11ec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-n-1012 = 2ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93b00fed463bd6a5a23e5190e12e5e248921c721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 -n-(1012-2ab) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"208\" height=\"21\" />. Notice the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c86e802b02490888501a6d8ef3e6836615e2129a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> occurs from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9487dda5ab148706f7d02946a93cbb6111c363ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 \\geq 2ab \\implies n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" /> by AM-GM, hence we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66ebd3bf4138902a00a34fe71d46c263d33fe936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - n-1012 = n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8e5d525f0492a531f6086c1553b3cd7bc13ed6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2n - 2024 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/855b08610d530cc30df4157319b1c5a013ed8851.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 46, -44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/8008578d9f4eebdd53014b917c5d12cdfa1c4b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e42302f9dd0afe4a7cd50ac2115f72bee849423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/4/c94ada1715fdabcafdac5e91d67da8173ee0a9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" /> എന്നും എടുക്കുക. അതായത്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/d/6fd6cbd3f9a4abdaea4ebf1dcf501319d0604b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)^2-2ab=n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"21\" />, അല്ലെങ്കിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3cad0556ce09c3683400ebee900fb2b5cdacc467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-2ab=n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f8793b64994d5c7f3c5451aa707a4eb15e7d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-n-1012=2ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />, അല്ലെങ്കിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de8d4d174c4291ad61d28a604dc396340bff9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-n-(1012-2ab)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"208\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c86e802b02490888501a6d8ef3e6836615e2129a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />-യുടെ പരമാവധി മൂല്യം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b3a82a0301ec686f4de4766be8e83439a82d71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2\\geq2ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"19\" /> എന്ന AM-GM പ്രകാരം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/518638a4efd1c669d01ccc4151232d4b7864c5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> ആണ്. അതിനാൽ നമുക്ക് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d106e944d2eb18703427a62445ec3472a5d8752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-n-1012=n+1012$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" /> ലഭിക്കുന്നു.\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a98cdafb7db6a9b7ba9f46fde3ec147cad689040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2-2n-2024=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />, കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026363a9b1e85acca029692e92fb5b6bfc588237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=46,-44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ ഉത്തരം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/8008578d9f4eebdd53014b917c5d12cdfa1c4b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{46}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> ആണ്.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 110/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5604/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37887:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070459 and revision id 292625. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}